    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Tanzania's Minister of Education, Science and Technology Prof Adolf Mkenda, together with a delegation, visited AKU's Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Station on August 25, 2023. AKDN Country Representative for Tanzania Mr Amin Kurji was also present.",
